== About me

I am a fourth year PhD student in the [https://tcs.nju.edu.cn/ theory group] of NJU advised by Prof. [https://liuexp.github.io/ Jingcheng Liu] and Prof. [https://tcs.nju.edu.cn/yinyt/ Yitong Yin]. Prior to this, I got my bachelor's degree from SDU in 2023 where I was advised by Prof. [https://www.cs.sdu.edu.cn/info/1070/2808.htm Haitao Jiang].
\n
I'm interested in TCS and focus on approximate sampling and counting now. Here is my [https://www.yixiaoyu.fun/cv.pdf CV]. 

